---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: collections.products
  size: 1
  alias: p
permalink: "/thank-you/{{ p.fileSlug }}/"
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Thank you — {{ p.data.title }}"
---
<div class="wrap ty">
  <div class="label">Order complete</div>
  <h1 class="display">Thank you, <em>truly</em></h1>
  <p>{{ p.data.title }} is yours. Your template link and setup guide are below, and a copy is on its way to your inbox.</p>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="label">Step one</div>
    <p style="margin:10px auto 18px">Open the link, sign in to Canva and press <i>Use template</i>. It creates your own copy to edit.</p>
    <div class="acts">
      {% if p.data.template_link %}<a class="btn solid" href="{{ p.data.template_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open your template in Canva →</a>{% endif %}
      {% if p.data.guide_pdf %}<a class="btn ghost" href="{{ p.data.guide_pdf }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the setup guide</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <p>Keep this page and the email — the link works whenever you need it. Something not right? Write to <a href="mailto:{{ settings.email }}">{{ settings.email }}</a>.</p>
</div>
